                  "fill": "#17120d",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 900,
                  "content": "The service wizard became the platform's architectural backbone — 5 developers coordinated across parallel workstreams branching off it. Route-based code splitting reduced main bundle by ~49.5%, improving FCP and TBT.",
